Subject: Serialize reentrant candidate updates and detach Rime context memory

InputMethodKit client callbacks can synchronously deliver another controller's
key event while the shared TextKit candidate panel is still being updated.
Serialize the complete Rime-to-TextKit snapshot across controllers, coalesce
nested refreshes onto the next main-run-loop turn, and release all C-owned
commit/status/context storage before entering IMK or AppKit.

